<div id="urduTextPath">پسران مسلم (ع)/پردیس میں مسلمؑ کے یتیموں پہ جفا ہے</div>
<p>pardes me muslim ke yatimo'n pa jafaa hai<br />
darya pa paye qatl adu leke chala hai<br />
chota to bade bhai ka mu dekh raha hai<br />
zor isko madad ka nahi mashghule buka hai</p>

<p>be rahem ke qaabu me hai do naazo'n ke paale<br />
har soo nigaraa'n hai ke koi aake bachaale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chote ko bade bhai hai badh badh ke bachata<br />
har baar hai mus'haf ki tarha beech me aata<br />
ro deta hai kuch kehne ka mouqa nahi paata<br />
be saaqata ek baat zabaa'n par hai ye laata</p>

<p>sun haal gharibo'n ka quda ke liye dam le<br />
ab ham tere ghar me kabhi aaye'n to qasam le<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kuch ghar me tere chain nahi paaya hai aisa<br />
todaa hai faqat paani se faaqa kayi din ka<br />
khud aaye nahi ki teri zouja ne tamanna<br />
hujre me namaze'n hai padhe aur kiya kya</p>

<p>ham bacche hai tu apni buzurgi pa amal kar<br />
taqseer jo kuch hamse huwi ho wo bahal kar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye jurm hai bin pooche jo aaye hai tere ghar<br />
hujre me rahe shab ko bhi bedaar barabar<br />
kurte phate, gesu chide, seli lagi hampar<br />
takleef bahut de chuka ab chod sitamgar</p>

<p>jangal me kahi'n baith ke ham royenge zaalim<br />
mu karke tere ghar ko na ab soyenge zaalim<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunta na tha mazloomo'n ki ek baat sitamgar<br />
dete the nida zouja-e- haris ko ye badh kar<br />
ye jaante to ham kabhi aate na tere ghar<br />
mehmano'n ko apne tu bachaati nahi maadar</p>

<p>chudh waade ke pakde huwe zulfo'n ko adu hai<br />
amma nahi baba nahi jo kuch hai so tu hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>balo'n ko bikhere huwe wo momina thi saath<br />
mazloomo'n ko zalim se chudaati thi wo qush zaat<br />
kehti thi quda ke liye kya karta hai badzaat<br />
geh paau'n pa sar rakhti thi geh baandhti thi haat</p>

<p>bas bas ke zami'n ab to hili jati hai zalim<br />
zehra mujhe sar nange nazar aati hai zalim<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zalim ne tah-e- tegh kiya zouja ko us aa'n<br />
ya fatima keh kar huwi zehra pa wo qurba'n<br />
darya pa adu laya unhe pakde garebaa'n<br />
di tegh ghulame habashi ko waha'n uryaa'n</p>

<p>ghusse se kaha dono ko ungli se dikha kar<br />
haan kaatle sar unke kinare pa tu jaakar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>talwar ko chamka ke badha wo habashi aah<br />
ye tegh tale sar ko jhuka kar huwe hamraah<br />
likha hai ke tha wo habashi marde haq aagaah<br />
raste me qitaab usse kiya dono ne nagaah</p>

<p>hamshakl bilaal-e- sha-e- loulaak ka tu hai<br />
sach keh ke payambar ka mohib hai ke adu hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farzand ko di haaris-e- maloon ne talwaar<br />
aur bola ke sar kaatle in dono ke ek baar<br />
wo bola ke mujhse ye nahi hoyega zinhaar<br />
ye tu hi hai bad baqt siyah roo-o- jafakaar</p>

<p>haaris tu pisar kis ka shaqi-e- azali hai<br />
maa fatima hai momino'n ke, baap ali hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tu kor hai zalim nazar aaye tujhe kyu kar<br />
le dekh nabi rote hai darya pa khule sar<br />
ye sunke utha haaris-e- maloon-o- sitamgar<br />
zalim ne kaha mujh ko nahi qouf-e- payambar</p>

<p>ek tegh tale dono baradar ko bitha kar<br />
sar kaata bade bhai ka chote ko dikhakar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sar paas rakha lash ko darya me bahaya<br />
bhai ke gale ka jo lahu qaak pa paaya<br />
ulfat se baradar ka lahu josh me aaya<br />
tab jod ke haath apne ye qatil ko sunaya</p>

<p>pochu'n ye lahu kurte se talwar jhukade<br />
lotu'n bade bhai ke lahu me jo raza de<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo bola ke ho shouq se ghaltaa'n mujhe kya dar<br />
bhai ke lahu me wo laga lotne girkar<br />
kehta tha bade bhai kaha'n dhoonde baradar<br />
tum to abhi baithe huwe the mere baradar</p>

<p>kis ne hi naseeb aise ulat'te huwe dekha<br />
bhai ne gala bhai ka kat'te huwe dekha<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>